Package: finalproject
Title: BST260 Final Project: Analyses of Public Health Datasets
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Zipiao",
           family = "Wan",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "wanzp.chiver2016@gmail.com")
Description: This package holds the code, data and narrative for a BST260
    (Fall 2026) final project. It documents the provenance of public health
    datasets, reports descriptive statistics for the variables of interest,
    and presents analyses with their findings and limitations. The results
    are published as a pkgdown site on GitHub Pages.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Suggests: knitr, testthat, rmarkdown, pkgdown, quarto
License: Artistic-2.0
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/Chiver/finalproject, https://chiver.github.io/finalproject
BugReports: https://github.com/Chiver/finalproject/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Roxygen: list(markdown=TRUE)
